== Coverage (pytest-cov)

#figure(image("rss/coverage.png", width: 90%), caption: [Coverage of the tests])

The coverage is 99%. The only line not tested is cli() under `if __name__ == "__main__"`, because the tests call the CLI with CliRunner and not from the terminal.
